        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spirit Catcher 93'</strong> is a single player, <strong>first-person horror</strong> game that plunges you into a desperate, retro-futuristic digital nightmare. You awaken not as a person, but as a shattered fragment, an echo of consciousness severed from its past. In this retro-futuristic digital nightmare, your only instinct is a desperate, unthinking pull toward escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE IS ALL THAT REMAINS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128630/extras/3db23ff8041816d1abb63a88dcf573a2.poster.avif?t=1773942005\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128630/extras/3db23ff8041816d1abb63a88dcf573a2.webm?t=1773942005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128630/extras/3db23ff8041816d1abb63a88dcf573a2.mp4?t=1773942005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no safety in this fractured reality. A force of unnatural order—the relentless <strong>Shepherd</strong>—stalks your every move. He is silent, methodical, and forever on your trail, determined to capture what you have become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE GUARDIAN WILL FIND YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128630/extras/37127f509e37aacc1fc7aad79c52c676.poster.avif?t=1773942005\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128630/extras/37127f509e37aacc1fc7aad79c52c676.webm?t=1773942005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128630/extras/37127f509e37aacc1fc7aad79c52c676.mp4?t=1773942005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Against the digital terror, you wield the mystical <strong>Spirit Catcher</strong>. It is a twisting conduit of raw energy, ready to transmute and carve a desperate path through whatever stands before you. Find a way to make it work or be consumed by the dark. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE SOUL IS YOUR WEAPON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128630/extras/e7347572194d14f8faf3f93e12db3725.poster.avif?t=1773942005\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128630/extras/e7347572194d14f8faf3f93e12db3725.webm?t=1773942005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128630/extras/e7347572194d14f8faf3f93e12db3725.mp4?t=1773942005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beyond the escape, a deeper mystery beckons. Uncover the elusive truth hidden within this fractured reality. Are you merely a simulation? Are you dead? Part of a terrifying experiment? Find the source or be lost to the terrifying depths forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE ABYSS BECKONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128630/extras/5a3360a6f3dbbcf4e9c776fffcd3acfb.poster.avif?t=1773942005\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128630/extras/5a3360a6f3dbbcf4e9c776fffcd3acfb.webm?t=1773942005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128630/extras/5a3360a6f3dbbcf4e9c776fffcd3acfb.mp4?t=1773942005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is designed to be a true challenge. It draws inspiration from <strong>classic, difficult games</strong>, meaning we deliberately <strong>minimize hand-holding</strong>. There are <strong>no tutorials</strong> to guide your every step, no safe spaces to retreat to, and no easy answers. You'll need to rely on your wits, observation, and skill to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning:</strong> High risk of soul-fragmentation. Standard hardware may struggle to contain The Shepherd.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spirit Catcher 93'</strong> is a single player, <strong>first-person horror</strong> game that plunges you into a desperate, retro-futuristic digital nightmare. You awaken not as a person, but as a shattered fragment, an echo of consciousness severed from its past. In this retro-futuristic digital nightmare, your only instinct is a desperate, unthinking pull toward escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE IS ALL THAT REMAINS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128630/extras/3db23ff8041816d1abb63a88dcf573a2.poster.avif?t=1773942005\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128630/extras/3db23ff8041816d1abb63a88dcf573a2.webm?t=1773942005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128630/extras/3db23ff8041816d1abb63a88dcf573a2.mp4?t=1773942005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no safety in this fractured reality. A force of unnatural order—the relentless <strong>Shepherd</strong>—stalks your every move. He is silent, methodical, and forever on your trail, determined to capture what you have become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE GUARDIAN WILL FIND YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128630/extras/37127f509e37aacc1fc7aad79c52c676.poster.avif?t=1773942005\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128630/extras