source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128630/extras/5a3360a6f3dbbcf4e9c776fffcd3acfb.webm?t=1773942005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128630/extras/5a3360a6f3dbbcf4e9c776fffcd3acfb.mp4?t=1773942005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is designed to be a true challenge. It draws inspiration from <strong>classic, difficult games</strong>, meaning we deliberately <strong>minimize hand-holding</strong>. There are <strong>no tutorials</strong> to guide your every step, no safe spaces to retreat to, and no easy answers. You'll need to rely on your wits, observation, and skill to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning:</strong> High risk of soul-fragmentation. Standard hardware may struggle to contain The Shepherd.</p>",
